(7235872, 1120225, 176157, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful place.  And you have a nice photo here. I like the blue sky here and the grass is perfect.  (If I remember, its about a 15 minute walk to Christains Pizza - the best in Virginia!)</td>', 'What a beautiful place.  And you have a nice photo here. I like the blue sky here and the grass is perfect.  (If I remember, its about a 15 minute walk to Christains Pizza - the best in Virginia!)', '2014-07-02 20:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
