(7236666, 1120548, 70270, '<td valign="top">wow.  the processing and light on this is beautiful.</td>', 'wow.  the processing and light on this is beautiful.', '2014-07-04 15:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236667, 1120250, 70270, '<td valign="top">nice! the grunge really suits this building well.</td>', 'nice! the grunge really suits this building well.', '2014-07-04 15:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236669, 1120549, 70270, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the processing a lot.  Definitely among the better images in the challenge, but for me the distracting perspective lines and the off center circle at the top hold it back from the top.</td>', 'I like the colors and the processing a lot.  Definitely among the better images in the challenge, but for me the distracting perspective lines and the off center circle at the top hold it back from the top.', '2014-07-04 15:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236670, 1120485, 70270, '<td valign="top">nice perspective and light.  wish there was something to carry that window at the top like the door and the arches to the right and left.</td>', 'nice perspective and light.  wish there was something to carry that window at the top like the door and the arches to the right and left.', '2014-07-04 15:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236671, 1120220, 70270, '<td valign="top">great window on the mission; far focus seems a bit soft.</td>', 'great window on the mission; far focus seems a bit soft.', '2014-07-04 15:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236722, 1119521, 16106, '<td valign="top">The whole scene seems a bit too yellow. Shifting it blue would have darkened the sky and made the foliage greener. Cloning out the street light would have helped as well. A good shot with  well chosen subject, well framed, but it could have been more.</td>', 'The whole scene seems a bit too yellow. Shifting it blue would have darkened the sky and made the foliage greener. Cloning out the street light would have helped as well. A good shot with  well chosen subject, well framed, but it could have been more.', '2014-07-04 17:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236723, 1120100, 16106, '<td valign="top">I wish you had framed in the rest of the door. I''m sure it was cluttered with people and other distractions, but this feels truncated, leaving me wondering what is missing rather than admiring all the lovely detail that you did present.</td>', 'I wish you had framed in the rest of the door. I''m sure it was cluttered with people and other distractions, but this feels truncated, leaving me wondering what is missing rather than admiring all the lovely detail that you did present.', '2014-07-04 17:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236724, 1120520, 16106, '<td valign="top">The tone mapping seems a bit strong, I like that you showed us detail in the shadows but the brickwork ends up over flattened. Framing up the flagpole on the exact edge of the building is a bit bothersome. It is a nice shot, but seems like it could have been more.</td>', 'The tone mapping seems a bit strong, I like that you showed us detail in the shadows but the brickwork ends up over flattened. Framing up the flagpole on the exact edge of the building is a bit bothersome. It is a nice shot, but seems like it could have been more.', '2014-07-04 17:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236726, 1120337, 16106, '<td valign="top">I love parts of this image, the jagged hole and the light on the stairs are great, but the guy in blue and his dog demand attention but do not integrate into the scene. The blue against the orange is good, but that steals the attention from the real star of the show.</td>', 'I love parts of this image, the jagged hole and the light on the stairs are great, but the guy in blue and his dog demand attention but do not integrate into the scene. The blue against the orange is good, but that steals the attention from the real star of the show.', '2014-07-04 17:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236727, 1120163, 16106, '<td valign="top">The leading lines and layering here are wonderful. The grey tinge of the image feels like it is caught between full saturation and B&amp;W, and for me either would have put this in ribbon land, as is..top ten.<br/>Editing out the security camera and pole would have been a good idea, that is a strong vertical in the wrong place.</td>', 'The leading lines and layering here are wonderful. The grey tinge of the image feels like it is caught between full saturation and B&W, and for me either would have put this in ribbon land, as is..top ten.Editing out the security camera and pole would have been a good idea, that is a strong vertical in the wrong place.', '2014-07-04 17:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236728, 1120125, 16106, '<td valign="top">If you had used a polarizer or slammed the luminance on the blue channel, I think the tower would have popped off the sky. Here the subject and background are similar enough in tone and texture to confound the eye a bit.</td>', 'If you had used a polarizer or slammed the luminance on the blue channel, I think the tower would have popped off the sky. Here the subject and background are similar enough in tone and texture to confound the eye a bit.', '2014-07-04 17:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236744, 1120419, 159196, '<td valign="top">My favorite in this challenge - great shot!</td>', 'My favorite in this challenge - great shot!', '2014-07-04 18:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
