(7236864, 1119242, 113411, '<td valign="top">fabulous!</td>', 'fabulous!', '2014-07-04 22:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236866, 1120057, 113411, '<td valign="top">fabulous shot!</td>', 'fabulous shot!', '2014-07-04 22:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236906, 1120061, 156466, '<td valign="top">For a main subject it''s too lost in the composition.  I''m guessing you could have moved around and still worked something nice with the lamppost and the reflection while better highlighting the building.  4</td>', 'For a main subject it''s too lost in the composition.  I''m guessing you could have moved around and still worked something nice with the lamppost and the reflection while better highlighting the building.  4', '2014-07-05 07:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236907, 1120481, 156466, '<td valign="top">The processing is kind of cool, and kind of hurting my head.  I see bits and pieces of things, but stuff gets way too lost.  Some folks will undoubtedly like the treatment, but not me. 4</td>', 'The processing is kind of cool, and kind of hurting my head.  I see bits and pieces of things, but stuff gets way too lost.  Some folks will undoubtedly like the treatment, but not me. 4', '2014-07-05 07:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236908, 1119729, 156466, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of the treatment, but given the subject I see why you did it. Interesting.  6</td>', 'I''m not a fan of the treatment, but given the subject I see why you did it. Interesting.  6', '2014-07-05 07:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236909, 1119771, 156466, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  Well composed.  I''m looking forward to seeing any historical info you may have linked.</td>', 'I really like this.  Well composed.  I''m looking forward to seeing any historical info you may have linked.', '2014-07-05 07:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236911, 1120100, 156466, '<td valign="top">See that line across the top?  It''s so close to the edge that you <i><b>have to</b></i> take the time to make it run parallel.  It''s nearly a nice piece of symmetry, but as is it''s a sloppy piece of near-symmetry.  Finish the work.  6 becomes a 4.</td>', 'See that line across the top?  It''s so close to the edge that you have to take the time to make it run parallel.  It''s nearly a nice piece of symmetry, but as is it''s a sloppy piece of near-symmetry.  Finish the work.  6 becomes a 4.', '2014-07-05 07:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236912, 1120485, 156466, '<td valign="top">What, you couldn''t wait for the sun to line those spots up?  ;)  I''m kidding, but I would have loved to have seen it that way.  My only critique is that you should have been a hair further right so that the tunnel is perfectly centered all the way down. 6 (would have been 7 with the tunnel fix, and 8 with the light)</td>', 'What, you couldn''t wait for the sun to line those spots up?  ;)  I''m kidding, but I would have loved to have seen it that way.  My only critique is that you should have been a hair further right so that the tunnel is perfectly centered all the way down. 6 (would have been 7 with the tunnel fix, and 8 with the light)', '2014-07-05 07:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236913, 1119242, 156466, '<td valign="top">Great site.  I don''t know if it''s that you''re not allowed to be closer, but I''m thinking there''s a far more interesting composition to be had here, even if you raised the camera up a bit and cropped in if the sky was a complete wash.</td>', 'Great site.  I don''t know if it''s that you''re not allowed to be closer, but I''m thinking there''s a far more interesting composition to be had here, even if you raised the camera up a bit and cropped in if the sky was a complete wash.', '2014-07-05 07:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236914, 1120161, 156466, '<td valign="top">Too structured, and the vignette is very distracting, particularly with what it does on the right edge (is that a path?).</td>', 'Too structured, and the vignette is very distracting, particularly with what it does on the right edge (is that a path?).', '2014-07-05 07:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236915, 1120375, 156466, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.</td>', 'Interesting composition.', '2014-07-05 07:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236916, 1120125, 156466, '<td valign="top">Just soooooo over processed.  And it feels like you cut off the bottom.</td>', 'Just soooooo over processed.  And it feels like you cut off the bottom.', '2014-07-05 08:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236917, 1120057, 156466, '<td valign="top">Absolutely lovely.  One of my favorites.</td>', 'Absolutely lovely.  One of my favorites.', '2014-07-05 08:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236918, 1120499, 156466, '<td valign="top">This is just screaming for a 1 degree rotation to the left.  You need at least that steeple to be vertical, not leaning right.</td>', 'This is just screaming for a 1 degree rotation to the left.  You need at least that steeple to be vertical, not leaning right.', '2014-07-05 08:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236919, 1120478, 156466, '<td valign="top">Cool edit.  I''m just getting worn out by over structured, HDR-like shots.  Composition feels weird, like you had to stretch it to include the sun.  Might have liked it more if you''d cropped the bottom 1/5 out.  I want to give it more than a 6, but I can''t.</td>', 'Cool edit.  I''m just getting worn out by over structured, HDR-like shots.  Composition feels weird, like you had to stretch it to include the sun.  Might have liked it more if you''d cropped the bottom 1/5 out.  I want to give it more than a 6, but I can''t.', '2014-07-05 08:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236920, 1119787, 156466, '<td valign="top">Fisheye?  Weird feel to the perspective correction - like you got the lines straight at the cost of leaving it with an unnatural pincushion-like distortion.  I don''t like it, but I don''t hate it either.  Very interesting.  6</td>', 'Fisheye?  Weird feel to the perspective correction - like you got the lines straight at the cost of leaving it with an unnatural pincushion-like distortion.  I don''t like it, but I don''t hate it either.  Very interesting.  6', '2014-07-05 08:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236921, 1119697, 156466, '<td valign="top">Step away from the structure slider.  It might work for the house, but the sky, benches and bricks are overdone. coulda been a 7, now it''s a 5</td>', 'Step away from the structure slider.  It might work for the house, but the sky, benches and bricks are overdone. coulda been a 7, now it''s a 5', '2014-07-05 08:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236922, 1119512, 156466, '<td valign="top">I feel like I''m repeating myself.  Step away from the structure slider.  It works for the building but over cooks the sky.  I think this would work better with a more symmetrical crop as well - too much to the left of center.</td>', 'I feel like I''m repeating myself.  Step away from the structure slider.  It works for the building but over cooks the sky.  I think this would work better with a more symmetrical crop as well - too much to the left of center.', '2014-07-05 08:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236923, 1120468, 156466, '<td valign="top">Need to back off the structure on the sky when you add it to the building.  Great place, nice colors, parts are just a little over cooked.  Could have easily been a 7 or 8 for me, but I can''t give it more than a 6.</td>', 'Need to back off the structure on the sky when you add it to the building.  Great place, nice colors, parts are just a little over cooked.  Could have easily been a 7 or 8 for me, but I can''t give it more than a 6.', '2014-07-05 08:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236924, 1119691, 156466, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but I''m not digging the treatment.</td>', 'Nice photo, but I''m not digging the treatment.', '2014-07-05 08:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236925, 1120094, 156466, '<td valign="top">More church, less trees. 5</td>', 'More church, less trees. 5', '2014-07-05 08:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236926, 1120520, 156466, '<td valign="top">(It''s not just you) My kingdom for less structure!!! 4</td>', '(It''s not just you) My kingdom for less structure!!! 4', '2014-07-05 08:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236927, 1119404, 156466, '<td valign="top">Was only there once, but I recognized it immediately.  Love the place, but the not the composition.  Maybe a tighter crop, let the mountain run out of the frame just above the cross?  And it''s just a hair (.5 degrees) rotated to the right.  5, but it could have been more.</td>', 'Was only there once, but I recognized it immediately.  Love the place, but the not the composition.  Maybe a tighter crop, let the mountain run out of the frame just above the cross?  And it''s just a hair (.5 degrees) rotated to the right.  5, but it could have been more.', '2014-07-05 08:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236928, 1119390, 156466, '<td valign="top">I like this one better than the other one.  I hope I don''t start a fight. :)  Like the other Malo shot, I''d like to see a tighter crop, and in this case, a little rotate to the left.</td>', 'I like this one better than the other one.  I hope I don''t start a fight. :)  Like the other Malo shot, I''d like to see a tighter crop, and in this case, a little rotate to the left.', '2014-07-05 08:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236929, 1120494, 156466, '<td valign="top">I''m being pummeled by over structuring. 5</td>', 'I''m being pummeled by over structuring. 5', '2014-07-05 08:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236930, 1120523, 156466, '<td valign="top">Sky''s a little too structured, and I''d love to see you pull just a little more shadow out of the porch area. Otherwise a real nice composition. 6</td>', 'Sky''s a little too structured, and I''d love to see you pull just a little more shadow out of the porch area. Otherwise a real nice composition. 6', '2014-07-05 08:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236931, 1120281, 156466, '<td valign="top">I want to like it but the lines don''t work for me.  I think I''d actually like it better rotated 90 (OK, 85) degrees to the right.</td>', 'I want to like it but the lines don''t work for me.  I think I''d actually like it better rotated 90 (OK, 85) degrees to the right.', '2014-07-05 08:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236932, 1120488, 156466, '<td valign="top">Kind of cool.  I know it''s supposed to be dark, but just a little more detail to the space under the screen would help.</td>', 'Kind of cool.  I know it''s supposed to be dark, but just a little more detail to the space under the screen would help.', '2014-07-05 08:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236933, 1120103, 156466, '<td valign="top">I''m giving you an extra point just for not over structuring this.  Thank you.</td>', 'I''m giving you an extra point just for not over structuring this.  Thank you.', '2014-07-05 08:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236934, 1120292, 156466, '<td valign="top">To paraphrase Mr. Dyson, just the proper amount of structure.</td>', 'To paraphrase Mr. Dyson, just the proper amount of structure.', '2014-07-05 08:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236935, 1120175, 156466, '<td valign="top">Ugh.  More overstructuring and halos. 5</td>', 'Ugh.  More overstructuring and halos. 5', '2014-07-05 08:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236936, 1120220, 156466, '<td valign="top">Oh, so much structure. Again.</td>', 'Oh, so much structure. Again.', '2014-07-05 08:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236937, 1120229, 156466, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2014-07-05 08:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236938, 1120386, 156466, '<td valign="top">If only the terraces and the building in particular had some level of sharpness. Nice composition, but not great execution.</td>', 'If only the terraces and the building in particular had some level of sharpness. Nice composition, but not great execution.', '2014-07-05 08:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236939, 1120438, 156466, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, just a tad overcooked in the sky portion for me.  A 7 that could have been more.</td>', 'Nice composition, just a tad overcooked in the sky portion for me.  A 7 that could have been more.', '2014-07-05 08:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236940, 1119733, 156466, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but I''m not big on the processing.</td>', 'Nice composition, but I''m not big on the processing.', '2014-07-05 08:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236954, 1120200, 118154, '<td valign="top">The crop at the bottom rather spoils the shot.</td>', 'The crop at the bottom rather spoils the shot.', '2014-07-05 10:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236955, 1120523, 118154, '<td valign="top">The sky is nicely exposed, but the building  is under.</td>', 'The sky is nicely exposed, but the building  is under.', '2014-07-05 10:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236957, 1120160, 118154, '<td valign="top">Hope you are ok after the fall.:)</td>', 'Hope you are ok after the fall.:)', '2014-07-05 10:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
