(7237302, 1120549, 58634, '<td valign="top">Very cool perspective. My very small issue with this is the fact that the center of the top part of the dome (where the white star looking thing is) isn''t actually centered to the rest of the circle and unfortunately to me that distracts from the geomentry of this image. Other than that, really nice warm colors.</td>', 'Very cool perspective. My very small issue with this is the fact that the center of the top part of the dome (where the white star looking thing is) isn''t actually centered to the rest of the circle and unfortunately to me that distracts from the geomentry of this image. Other than that, really nice warm colors.', '2014-07-06 16:58:34.000000', NULL, 1);
