(7237303, 1120548, 58634, '<td valign="top">Simple and nice. I think that what I like most about this is the fact that the sky is void of any clouds, it adds a certain something to the simplicity of this and it really makes you focus on the actual church.</td>', 'Simple and nice. I think that what I like most about this is the fact that the sky is void of any clouds, it adds a certain something to the simplicity of this and it really makes you focus on the actual church.', '2014-07-06 16:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
