(7237534, 1120531, 16106, '<td valign="top">I always try to comment on my top scorer that places the furthest down the list. Either "you were robbed" or "I like it anyway". Not super sound technically; a touch soft on the focus, and the burn line to bring out details below the marquee is too obvious. Never the less the subject is great, the framing is dynamic and makes great use of diagonals, and the colors are defty handled. I fugured this for the top 20. I still think it is a solid shot with a few minor mistakes.</td>', 'I always try to comment on my top scorer that places the furthest down the list. Either "you were robbed" or "I like it anyway". Not super sound technically; a touch soft on the focus, and the burn line to bring out details below the marquee is too obvious. Never the less the subject is great, the framing is dynamic and makes great use of diagonals, and the colors are defty handled. I fugured this for the top 20. I still think it is a solid shot with a few minor mistakes.', '2014-07-07 01:21:33.000000', NULL, 0),
