(7238414, 1120438, 58634, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the top ten finish with this image. It''s truly a gorgeous representation of this landmark. I should''ve guessed that this was architecture from Latin America :)<br/> <br/>I was under the impression that the altars in the background were part of this building, at least it seems that way!</td>', 'Congrats on the top ten finish with this image. It''s truly a gorgeous representation of this landmark. I should''ve guessed that this was architecture from Latin America :) I was under the impression that the altars in the background were part of this building, at least it seems that way!', '2014-07-08 01:03:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(7238475, 1120201, 96574, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Garry:</b></div><hr/><i> Nice shot, Mark. How close a representation is the green water to what it was in reality? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Garry (and everyone) for the comments.  The water is actually that murky green color.  I''m thinking probably due to the algae content in it.</td>', 'Originally posted by Garry: Nice shot, Mark. How close a representation is the green water to what it was in reality?   Thanks Garry (and everyone) for the comments.  The water is actually that murky green color.  I''m thinking probably due to the algae content in it.', '2014-07-08 03:26:44.000000', NULL, 0),
